<#@ template language="C#" inherits="IntentTemplateBase<Intent.Modelers.Services.CQRS.Api.QueryModel>" #>
<#@ assembly name="System.Core" #>
<#@ import namespace="System.Collections.Generic" #>
<#@ import namespace="System.Linq" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modules.Common.Templates" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Metadata.Models" #>
<#@ import namespace="Intent.Modelers.Services.CQRS.Api" #>
<#@ import namespace="Aryzac.GitHubIssues.Api" #>
---
id: <#= Model.Id #>::<#= GetHttpSettingsDefinitionId() #>
title: "task(api): <#= GetVerb() #> <#= GetRoute() #> for <#= Model.Name #>"
type: task
<# if (Model.HasGitHubIssueClosed()) { #>
closed: true
<# } else { #>
closed: false
<# } #>
---
<# if (Model.HasBusinessRequirement()) { #>

### Business Goal

<#= Model.GetBusinessRequirement().Summary() #>
<# if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.Comment)) { #>

<#= Model.Comment #>
<# } } #>

### Scope & Notes

| Property | Type | Nullable | Description |
|-----------|------|----------|-------------|
<# foreach (var property in Model.Properties) { #>
| <#= property.Name #> | <#= property.TypeReference.Element.Name #> <#= property.TypeReference.IsCollection ? "[]" : "" #> | <#= property.TypeReference.IsNullable ? "Yes" : "No" #> | <#= string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(property.Comment) ? "" : property.Comment #> |
<# } #>

Estimated Effort
Estimated Days: 0.5

| Task                                   | Target Hours      | Actual Hours |
|----------------------------------------|-------------------|--------------|
| Confirm/create command handler         | 0.5h              |              |
| Implement controller POST action       | 0.5h              |              |
| Update response types / docs           | 0.25h             |              |
| Integration tests (happy + validation) | 1.0h              |              |
| Documentation updates                  | 0.25h             |              |
| Buffer                                 | 0.25h             |              |
| Total Target Hours                     | 2.75h (≈ 0.5 day) |              |

Acceptance Checklist
- [ ] Create command handler exists and returns identifier/DTO
- [ ] Controller POST action returns 201 + Location header
- [ ] Validation errors surface as 400 (FluentValidation wired)
- [ ] Auth + tenant requirements enforced (or N/A documented)
- [ ] Integration tests cover success + validation failure
- [ ] Documentation updated (this recipe referenced)
- [ ] Effort variance >20% recorded in issue comments